:: Prologue1.1
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Prologue - 1</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>It is raining heavily. You are walking along a soaking gravel path, leading to the entrance to the airport of Faroe.</p>
            <p><i>“Weather isn’t looking so great”</i>, you think to yourself, walking faster and faster to reach the airport quicker.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Prologue1.2]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Prologue1.2
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Prologue - 2</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>You booked a flight couple of weeks in advance already. And just now, you get a notification on your phone.</p>
            <br>
            <hr>
            <p><i>“Widerøe: Your flight WF285 to Bergen is delayed. Due to weather, and ultimately your safety, this flight will now be operated by Norwegian (Boeing 737-800).”</i></p>
            <hr>
            <br>
            <p><i>“What a shocker”</i>- you said, continuing walking down a wet gravel path.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter1.0]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>
